WEBVTT

01:36.120 --> 01:40.970
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.240 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 10]

01:45.840 --> 01:47.900
Today, I'm going to spar with you all.

01:49.000 --> 01:50.670
If anyone can take

01:50.840 --> 01:52.570
the Hero Command Token from me,

01:52.840 --> 01:54.430
I'll honor him as a real man.

01:55.360 --> 01:57.030
I'll hand over the token

01:58.150 --> 02:01.870
and give him the Voidheart Codex.

02:10.300 --> 02:12.340
If you can't defeat me, Crazy Yan,

02:13.470 --> 02:16.840
you'll have to follow my orders
from now on!

03:34.240 --> 03:35.280
Who else?

03:59.000 --> 04:01.060
You attacked us with hidden weapons.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.940
I'm done playing with you all.

04:26.750 --> 04:28.880
"Behold the divine token of mystery."

04:28.950 --> 04:31.010
“All heroes shall bow immediately.”

04:31.720 --> 04:32.470
Suifeng,

04:33.159 --> 04:35.290
do you know what this token signifies?

04:36.240 --> 04:38.300
Everyone in the martial world knows.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.190
That's right.

04:39.530 --> 04:42.630
When the leaders of Shaolin Sect,
Wudang Sect, and Emei Sect

04:42.630 --> 04:43.920
made this token,

04:44.430 --> 04:45.510
they pressed their fingerprints

04:45.510 --> 04:47.000
on it.

04:48.190 --> 04:51.720
Take a look at the fingerprints on it.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.680
No fingerprints.

04:57.600 --> 04:58.390
It's fake.

04:59.730 --> 05:01.660
Actually, there's one more thing.

05:02.310 --> 05:04.510
There's only one Mr. Qiu in Sword Manor.

05:04.870 --> 05:07.510
How can we be sure there isn't a second?

05:08.470 --> 05:11.230
Qiushui, your thoughts...

05:14.190 --> 05:15.190
What I mean is—

05:16.270 --> 05:17.860
everyone is fighting to seize

05:17.860 --> 05:20.460
the Hero Command Token
in Old Madam Wu's hands.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.530
To ensure absolute safety,

05:23.120 --> 05:23.850
Old Madam Wu,

05:24.510 --> 05:26.710
you must consider an alternative plan.

05:27.870 --> 05:29.260
Xiao Qiushui.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.630
It must be him.

05:36.950 --> 05:37.510
Chief,

05:38.159 --> 05:40.240
Liu Suifeng is known
for his flawless strategies.

05:40.240 --> 05:41.360
He's incredibly clever.

05:41.360 --> 05:43.430
How could anyone possibly deceive him?

05:43.430 --> 05:46.190
He must have hidden the real token
to fool you.

05:46.580 --> 05:47.140
Chief,

05:47.750 --> 05:48.950
he lost men

05:49.510 --> 05:51.110
and returned empty-handed.

05:51.470 --> 05:53.400
Shouldn't he give an explanation?

06:09.630 --> 06:10.560
-Chief.
-Chief.

06:12.310 --> 06:14.510
Suifeng's Cosmos in the Sleeve technique

06:14.510 --> 06:15.950
has reached a new level.

06:17.160 --> 06:17.870
Tell me,

06:19.560 --> 06:23.560
should this petal remain on its branch?

06:24.360 --> 06:25.120
Or...

06:26.560 --> 06:28.620
should it be plucked into one's hand?

06:33.830 --> 06:34.430
Chief,

06:35.190 --> 06:36.310
plucking it from the branch

06:36.310 --> 06:38.510
grants but a moment of fleeting beauty.

06:38.560 --> 06:40.290
Only by remaining on the branch

06:40.360 --> 06:41.820
can its fragrance endure.

06:44.750 --> 06:46.390
The Power Gang is the branch.

06:46.600 --> 06:48.040
We are but its blossoms.

06:48.560 --> 06:50.120
If we fight, we fall from the branch.

06:50.120 --> 06:52.720
Only by clinging close
can we retain our grace.

06:54.510 --> 06:57.240
I believe
Suifeng was merely careless this time.

06:58.630 --> 07:00.560
He's been overworked these years.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.350
That's why he fell short.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.430
After today,

07:03.680 --> 07:05.680
let Sword King and Suifeng

07:06.720 --> 07:09.450
investigate
the token's whereabouts together.

07:27.120 --> 07:27.870
[Chief,]

07:28.580 --> 07:30.980
[I will get
the Hero Command Token for you.]

07:31.640 --> 07:35.000
[Then I will come to apologize to you.]

08:09.160 --> 08:11.620
You're injured. You shouldn't be drinking.

08:18.270 --> 08:19.930
I'm the one who lost a brother.

08:20.070 --> 08:22.200
If anyone should be drinking, it's me.

08:28.000 --> 08:28.800
Rou.

08:34.429 --> 08:35.760
I failed to protect you.

08:37.720 --> 08:39.049
Life is unpredictable.

08:40.440 --> 08:42.240
What could you have done anyway?

08:43.840 --> 08:44.960
At first, I thought

08:48.840 --> 08:50.500
the martial world was simple.

08:52.320 --> 08:54.520
As long as I was smart and played it safe,

08:55.550 --> 08:57.550
I could overcome the difficulties.

08:58.510 --> 09:01.600
I thought
loyalty came first in the martial world.

09:03.150 --> 09:05.480
As long as I treated my friends sincerely,

09:08.030 --> 09:10.490
we could trust each other unconditionally.

09:14.790 --> 09:15.630
I thought

09:17.440 --> 09:18.570
I could change fate.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.290
Unfortunately,

09:25.840 --> 09:27.900
those were just my wishful thinking.

09:33.870 --> 09:34.670
In the end,

09:38.960 --> 09:40.360
I accomplished nothing.

09:45.390 --> 09:46.480
Now I understand

09:48.320 --> 09:50.150
why Tang Rou trusted you so much

09:52.200 --> 09:53.790
and wouldn't come home all day,

09:53.790 --> 09:55.390
refusing to leave your side.

09:57.030 --> 09:59.320
Regardless of life or death,
success or failure,

09:59.320 --> 10:00.910
regardless of gain or loss,

10:01.750 --> 10:03.390
you do what you want to do.

10:04.670 --> 10:05.470
Xiao Qiushui,

10:07.120 --> 10:09.360
you live a life others envy,

10:10.670 --> 10:12.200
yet it feels almost unreal.

10:15.030 --> 10:15.510
Yes.

10:18.510 --> 10:20.040
It really does feel unreal.

10:24.390 --> 10:26.270
The martial world is treacherous,

10:26.270 --> 10:28.130
and human hearts are hard to read.

10:28.960 --> 10:31.840
People scheme endlessly

10:32.510 --> 10:33.570
for what they want.

10:34.750 --> 10:36.210
How many ever treat others

10:37.240 --> 10:39.000
with the sincerity you show?

10:44.870 --> 10:47.910
I don't know anything about fate,

10:48.870 --> 10:49.870
but I do know this:

10:50.870 --> 10:53.510
when Feng Lang kidnapped me,

10:55.030 --> 10:56.760
you risked your life to save me.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.440
Otherwise,

10:59.670 --> 11:01.200
I wouldn't be here now

11:01.200 --> 11:02.600
talking to you like this.

11:05.030 --> 11:06.490
Don't forget what you said

11:06.670 --> 11:07.550
to Tang Rou.

11:08.960 --> 11:10.420
We'll avenge him together

11:11.030 --> 11:13.720
against the Power Gang.

12:01.600 --> 12:02.550
Mr. Zhang,

12:07.030 --> 12:09.030
let the matters of the martial world

12:10.050 --> 12:11.650
remain in the martial world.

12:16.910 --> 12:20.630
Mr. Zhang helped me
keep the Hero Command Token.

12:21.550 --> 12:23.200
Feng Lang didn't take it.

12:24.000 --> 12:27.670
This game is not completely lost yet.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.000
Mr. Zhang

12:30.440 --> 12:32.240
stayed by my side for many years.

12:33.790 --> 12:37.440
I understand his thoughts
better than anyone.

12:39.750 --> 12:43.480
He had long been indifferent
to life and death in the martial world.

12:44.240 --> 12:45.440
Staying by my side was

12:46.270 --> 12:48.270
only for the sake of loyalty.

12:49.840 --> 12:50.720
And now,

12:52.510 --> 12:55.910
he saw that same quality in you.

12:57.320 --> 12:59.390
Today, when he regained consciousness,

12:59.390 --> 13:02.750
he told me if he could have a disciple,

13:03.790 --> 13:05.790
he would want one like you, Qiushui.

13:10.600 --> 13:14.150
This dagger was
Mr. Zhang's most personal possession.

13:14.630 --> 13:17.080
He asked me to give it to you.

13:18.270 --> 13:20.870
If you become a true hero soon,

13:21.360 --> 13:23.420
that would fulfill Mr. Zhang's wish.

13:32.630 --> 13:36.030
I'm grateful
for your and Mr. Zhang's kindness.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.640
Sword Manor is still in trouble.

13:50.200 --> 13:53.600
My son's old cavalry troops are stationed
in the mountains.

13:54.240 --> 13:56.300
If I order them to rescue Sword Manor,

13:56.950 --> 13:59.240
we could solve the Xiao family's problem.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.440
That must not happen.

14:01.030 --> 14:01.760
Old Madam Wu,

14:02.390 --> 14:03.910
I want to save my parents

14:05.320 --> 14:07.120
and everyone of the Xiao family.

14:07.190 --> 14:10.650
But the Xiao family's trouble is a matter
in the martial world.

14:11.560 --> 14:13.690
If we rashly deploy military cavalry,

14:14.030 --> 14:15.630
the garrison forces in Jindu

14:15.960 --> 14:17.670
will surely clash with them.

14:18.390 --> 14:20.650
Then the people in the city would suffer,

14:21.480 --> 14:25.320
and the court would
grow even more suspicious of General Wu.

14:29.160 --> 14:32.470
Then what should we do about Sword Manor?

14:33.670 --> 14:37.150
I'd like to ask you to send a messenger

14:38.550 --> 14:40.350
on horseback to Guangling Villa

14:40.350 --> 14:42.550
to deliver a letter to my brother
to ask for help.

14:42.550 --> 14:45.790
Tomorrow, I will set out to seek aid
from various sects in Jinzhong.

14:45.790 --> 14:48.120
I have support from my sworn brothers too.

14:50.000 --> 14:53.390
I will do everything in my power
to save the Xiao family.

14:54.750 --> 14:55.390
Okay.

14:56.320 --> 14:58.320
Tomorrow I'll send someone to Guangling

14:58.320 --> 15:00.320
to deliver a letter to your brother.

15:02.360 --> 15:06.030
After that,
I must focus on my son's matters.

15:07.910 --> 15:08.970
May the Xiao family

15:10.150 --> 15:11.610
remain safe through this.

15:14.670 --> 15:16.000
Thank you, Old Madam Wu.

15:56.480 --> 15:57.200
Master.

15:58.670 --> 16:01.360
These Stone Pine Pills are great
for your health.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.360
Try them, Master.

16:14.960 --> 16:16.560
Who do you think you are to me?

16:18.000 --> 16:19.730
Focus on the tasks I assign you.

16:19.910 --> 16:21.710
Do not overstep the boundaries.

16:25.150 --> 16:25.750
Yes.

16:38.200 --> 16:38.870
Shirong.

16:41.320 --> 16:43.600
Are you still thinking
about what Chief said?

16:43.600 --> 16:45.240
I dare not doubt his words.

16:46.550 --> 16:47.440
Remember this:

16:47.960 --> 16:50.160
do not force things beyond your limits.

16:50.320 --> 16:52.520
Trying to do the work of many by yourself

16:52.870 --> 16:54.910
will inevitably lead to oversights.

16:54.910 --> 16:55.970
I admit my mistake.

16:57.510 --> 17:00.910
I heard this time, you used
the Turtle Snake Hibernation technique.

17:00.910 --> 17:02.640
It's very harmful to your body.

17:03.270 --> 17:05.400
I've brought you some Stone Pine Pills.

17:05.400 --> 17:07.440
Take them. They should help.

17:12.270 --> 17:13.400
Thank you, Shirong.

17:14.270 --> 17:16.200
Rest well. I'm leaving.

17:23.480 --> 17:24.440
Do not

17:24.880 --> 17:26.810
act on your own in certain matters.

17:36.350 --> 17:37.150
Song Mingzhu.

17:37.920 --> 17:38.440
Master.

17:39.030 --> 17:41.240
Old Madam Wu only had contact
with people from the Xiao family.

17:41.240 --> 17:44.440
The Hero Command Token
must be related to the Xiao family.

17:45.310 --> 17:47.240
Start with the people around Old Madam Wu.

17:47.240 --> 17:48.550
Investigate thoroughly.

17:48.550 --> 17:49.280
Understood.

18:00.550 --> 18:01.240
Tang Rou.

18:04.790 --> 18:05.520
Big Brother.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.870
What are you looking at?

18:09.870 --> 18:12.180
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

18:12.200 --> 18:16.910
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

18:15.200 --> 18:15.930
Big Brother,

18:16.750 --> 18:18.000
do you believe there's a next life?

18:17.170 --> 18:19.520
♪ The wind blows ♪

18:19.550 --> 18:23.990
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

18:22.880 --> 18:23.830
I don't think so.

18:24.590 --> 18:27.040
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

18:27.060 --> 18:29.530
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

18:27.110 --> 18:29.240
Why ask something like that suddenly?

18:29.550 --> 18:32.660
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

18:33.350 --> 18:40.630
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

18:35.830 --> 18:37.090
If there is a next life,

18:38.240 --> 18:40.040
I'd still be your sworn brother.

18:40.770 --> 18:48.720
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

18:45.110 --> 18:45.750
Tang Rou.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.700
[This is crazy again.]

19:30.350 --> 19:31.750
[I impersonated that demon,]

19:31.750 --> 19:33.680
[but that doesn't mean I know him.]

19:33.790 --> 19:35.680
[He's the Deputy Chief of the Power Gang.]

19:35.680 --> 19:37.610
[How could I possibly reform him?]

19:41.200 --> 19:43.940
[Mission 3: Reform Liu Suifeng]

20:00.950 --> 20:03.150
[Tang Rou died. Feng Lang betrayed us.]

20:03.720 --> 20:05.180
[And there's Kang Chuyu.]

20:05.830 --> 20:08.160
[The martial world is full of surprises.]

20:09.240 --> 20:10.240
[What's worse is]

20:10.310 --> 20:11.830
[I didn't pay close attention
to the story]

20:11.830 --> 20:13.630
[after escorting Old Madam Wu.]

20:15.440 --> 20:17.970
[From now on,
I really must tread carefully.]

20:18.720 --> 20:20.160
[The most important thing now is]

20:20.160 --> 20:21.310
[to rescue the Xiao family
as soon as possible]

20:21.310 --> 20:24.040
[and ask Father
for the position of sect leader.]

20:24.110 --> 20:26.110
[Only by returning
to the Magic Codex I wrote]

20:26.110 --> 20:28.710
[will there be a chance
to turn things around.]

20:52.160 --> 20:54.640
Qiushui feared implicating others again,

20:55.070 --> 20:56.640
so he insisted on going alone

20:56.640 --> 20:58.240
and didn't bid you farewell.

20:58.550 --> 20:59.750
But he left a message:

21:00.000 --> 21:01.720
the martial world is dangerous.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.720
You should return to Tang Sect soon.

21:03.790 --> 21:05.920
After he solves the Xiao family's problem

21:05.920 --> 21:07.240
and avenges Tang Rou,

21:07.720 --> 21:10.240
he will meet you at Tang Sect.

21:10.720 --> 21:13.320
Then you can pay respects
to Tang Rou together.

21:17.070 --> 21:17.550
Sir,

21:17.790 --> 21:19.680
please arrange
the fastest carriage to Jinzhong.

21:18.510 --> 21:20.130
[Carriage Shop]

21:20.480 --> 21:21.680
When will you depart?

21:21.960 --> 21:23.640
Now. Arrange it immediately.

21:28.550 --> 21:30.550
[Mother gave me so many banknotes.]

21:31.640 --> 21:34.510
[Father, Mother, wait for me.]

21:36.630 --> 21:38.890
[I'll find a way to save the Xiao family.]

21:43.000 --> 21:43.790
Okay. Okay.

21:44.070 --> 21:45.550
Erzhu! Erzhu!

21:45.830 --> 21:46.440
Sir.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.000
Hurry!

21:47.240 --> 21:49.020
Take this gentleman to pick a good horse.

21:49.020 --> 21:49.770
Okay. Please.

21:49.770 --> 21:50.660
This way, sir.

22:19.250 --> 22:22.910
Didn't they say white willow bark
reduces inflammation and pain,

22:22.920 --> 22:24.230
just like aspirin?

22:27.680 --> 22:29.000
Seems it doesn't work.

22:47.590 --> 22:48.920
The one in the carriage?

22:49.110 --> 22:50.510
Yes, that's him.

22:50.960 --> 22:52.560
He's carrying a lot of money.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.640
This plot is so cliché.

22:57.830 --> 23:00.270
Must every journey involve a robbery?

23:03.680 --> 23:04.790
What awful luck.

23:05.640 --> 23:07.440
Get down! Hand over your money!

23:07.720 --> 23:09.270
Get down! Hurry up!

23:53.310 --> 23:55.640
Why did you leave without saying goodbye?

24:00.790 --> 24:01.790
I have my own path.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.840
You represent Tang Sect.

24:06.510 --> 24:08.110
Don't get involved in this anymore.

24:08.110 --> 24:08.910
Xiao Qiushui.

24:10.270 --> 24:11.350
You once said

24:11.830 --> 24:14.200
loyalty binds us in this world.

24:14.750 --> 24:15.790
I believed you.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.340
Are you afraid of implicating me?

24:22.550 --> 24:23.680
Rou is already gone.

24:26.440 --> 24:28.440
I don't want to lose another friend.

24:28.550 --> 24:29.480
What do you mean?

24:30.270 --> 24:31.670
When you risked your life

24:31.680 --> 24:33.080
to save me from Feng Lang,

24:34.030 --> 24:37.030
did I leave without a word
for fear of implicating you?

24:38.680 --> 24:39.720
Put yourself in my shoes.

24:39.720 --> 24:41.980
I don't want to owe anyone favors anyway.

24:45.790 --> 24:47.850
Avenging my brother isn't something

24:48.720 --> 24:50.120
I'll leave to outsiders.

24:52.750 --> 24:55.080
Since I chose
to stay with the Xiao family,

24:55.640 --> 24:58.400
I'll see it through to the end.

24:58.680 --> 24:59.410
Understand?

25:03.400 --> 25:04.200
Enough talk.

25:05.270 --> 25:07.550
You there! Come and pull the carriage!

25:20.030 --> 25:20.790
Walk faster!

25:21.880 --> 25:22.550
Steady now!

25:23.310 --> 25:24.030
Yes. Yes.

25:31.710 --> 25:33.370
Apply the medicine yourself.

25:40.270 --> 25:42.330
[Are all martial artists like this?]

25:43.070 --> 25:44.070
[Bad-tempered,]

25:45.510 --> 25:47.240
[but very loyal.]

25:51.160 --> 25:51.590
Miss,

25:52.110 --> 25:53.400
we've built the fire

25:53.880 --> 25:55.680
and stacked the spare firewood.

25:55.720 --> 25:57.510
Can you let us go now?

25:58.200 --> 26:00.030
It'll do. Get lost.

26:01.070 --> 26:01.590
Wait.

26:04.200 --> 26:04.960
If I catch you

26:04.960 --> 26:07.110
doing these evil deeds again,

26:07.350 --> 26:09.110
I'll gouge your eyes out.

26:09.110 --> 26:09.880
Got it?

26:10.310 --> 26:11.720
Yes. Yes. Got it.

26:11.720 --> 26:12.310
Leave.

26:12.920 --> 26:13.880
Hurry.

26:14.750 --> 26:17.680
Why didn't you make them cook
before letting them go?

26:18.550 --> 26:19.570
I'll call them back.

26:19.570 --> 26:21.180
Forget it. Don't bother.

26:21.750 --> 26:24.080
They don't look like they can cook anyway.

26:25.720 --> 26:26.850
I can't cook either.

26:28.160 --> 26:28.880
Just wait.

26:41.930 --> 26:42.610
Here.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.430
Sweet milk?

26:57.680 --> 26:58.750
When we were kids,

26:59.000 --> 27:02.030
if we were upset,
something sweet always helped.

27:18.440 --> 27:19.770
You can't swallow that?

27:23.680 --> 27:25.160
It'll be ready in an hour.

27:43.030 --> 27:44.270
I remember back then,

27:45.440 --> 27:46.640
Tang Sect was strict—

27:48.830 --> 27:50.480
endless training every day.

27:51.880 --> 27:53.210
If we failed the trials,

27:53.680 --> 27:56.030
we would be punished and go hungry.

27:56.960 --> 27:59.090
Tang Rou would sneak into the kitchen,

27:59.310 --> 28:01.350
scrounge up some leftovers,

28:01.920 --> 28:02.980
mix them together,

28:03.260 --> 28:04.860
and heat them up on the stove.

28:05.630 --> 28:07.890
We would huddle together and share them.

28:19.560 --> 28:21.160
This feels like those times.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.210
They say the stars in the sky are

28:40.350 --> 28:41.610
those who have left us.

28:42.860 --> 28:46.210
Then Tang Rou must be watching over you
from up there.

28:47.430 --> 28:49.190
If you are this sad,

28:50.480 --> 28:51.640
he'll be sad too.

28:58.070 --> 29:00.400
Sounds like something to comfort a child.

29:03.820 --> 29:04.940
Where I come from,

29:06.070 --> 29:07.200
everyone says that.

29:08.090 --> 29:10.160
Different stars have different meanings.

29:10.160 --> 29:11.020
They are called

29:12.440 --> 29:13.440
constellations.

29:14.920 --> 29:15.920
Constellations?

29:16.960 --> 29:19.110
Aren't you from Jinzhong?

29:22.440 --> 29:23.030
Yes, I am.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.000
Then why haven't I heard of this?

29:26.640 --> 29:28.900
It's normal that you haven't heard of it.

29:29.110 --> 29:32.240
It's relatively niche.

29:32.350 --> 29:34.210
You wouldn't understand anyway.

29:37.480 --> 29:40.240
I think Tang Rou was probably a Libra.

29:41.680 --> 29:42.640
He was gentle,

29:43.480 --> 29:44.240
righteous,

29:45.480 --> 29:46.160
and kind.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.260
He valued friends.

29:53.590 --> 29:54.790
He was a good brother.

30:00.790 --> 30:02.520
He should be in that direction.

30:07.110 --> 30:10.750
Among those twinkling stars,

30:12.480 --> 30:13.590
one of them is him.

30:15.480 --> 30:18.440
He'll always shine upon us

30:20.240 --> 30:21.640
and always watch over us.

30:31.120 --> 30:33.640
So everyone has a different constellation?

30:34.270 --> 30:35.110
What's mine?

30:38.790 --> 30:39.480
You?

30:41.240 --> 30:43.030
You're stubborn,

30:43.140 --> 30:45.540
passionate, hot-tempered, and reckless.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.390
But of course,

30:48.510 --> 30:50.680
your courage is admirable,

30:52.200 --> 30:53.660
and you're pure-hearted.

30:54.400 --> 30:57.200
I think you might be an Aries.

31:02.920 --> 31:04.450
That's quite interesting.

31:13.460 --> 31:15.060
This is the symbol for Libra.

31:15.640 --> 31:16.570
Keep it with you—

31:16.740 --> 31:18.980
as if Tang Rou is always by your side.

31:42.920 --> 31:44.350
[Wave-Listening Pavilion]

31:43.640 --> 31:44.240
Master.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.750
Nothing particularly useful was uncovered.

31:47.750 --> 31:50.350
Xiao Qiushui and Old Madam Wu
have parted ways.

31:51.240 --> 31:53.100
Miss Tang Fang has gone after him.

31:53.470 --> 31:56.510
Maybe Xiao Qiushui
does have the Hero Command Token.

31:59.550 --> 32:00.590
But a man like him—

32:01.240 --> 32:03.000
even if he has the token,

32:03.480 --> 32:05.680
he would never use it for personal gain.

32:06.310 --> 32:08.440
He would surely seek aid along the way.

32:09.070 --> 32:11.310
Unfortunately, all the sects in Jinzhong

32:11.310 --> 32:13.910
would never dare
stand against the Power Gang.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.730
But Tang Fang will help him.

32:19.070 --> 32:20.800
Contact Tang Sect's Tang Song.

32:21.480 --> 32:23.610
Would Tang Sect truly dare interfere?

32:24.070 --> 32:26.310
To become the leader of Tang Sect,

32:26.440 --> 32:28.960
Tang Song has repeatedly tried
to please the Power Gang.

32:28.960 --> 32:31.110
Master,
haven't you always looked down on him?

32:31.110 --> 32:31.750
Trash is

32:32.550 --> 32:34.070
not entirely useless.

32:35.310 --> 32:37.110
Offer Tang Song some incentives.

32:37.110 --> 32:38.840
Ask him to prepare thoroughly.

32:39.720 --> 32:40.450
Understood.

32:43.780 --> 32:45.080
[Ding's Mansion]

32:53.950 --> 32:55.110
I'd like to see

32:55.750 --> 32:58.410
how sick your master is
that he can't even get up!

32:58.720 --> 33:00.580
He wants to hide like a coward now?

33:01.240 --> 33:01.840
Tang Fang,

33:02.590 --> 33:03.390
don't be rude.

33:04.720 --> 33:05.520
Xiao Qiushui,

33:05.920 --> 33:07.920
you barged into my mansion
with this unruly girl.

33:07.920 --> 33:10.580
Do you mean to extort repayment
for past favors?

33:11.880 --> 33:15.200
I wonder
if you plan to repay the kindness.

33:15.640 --> 33:17.900
I simply don't want to act against reason

33:18.160 --> 33:20.550
and end up aiding those
with ulterior motives.

33:20.550 --> 33:21.830
Who knows if the Xiao family

33:21.830 --> 33:23.350
is truly as the rumors say—

33:23.720 --> 33:25.240
coveting the Hero Command Token

33:25.240 --> 33:28.000
and bringing the Power Gang's wrath
upon yourselves?

33:28.000 --> 33:29.160
Watch your words!

33:31.550 --> 33:34.750
It's understandable
that you want to stay out of trouble.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.760
But why slander the Xiao family?

33:37.270 --> 33:39.070
What the Xiao family suffers today

33:39.070 --> 33:42.000
may befall the Ding family tomorrow.

33:42.270 --> 33:42.830
You...

33:43.110 --> 33:44.270
How dare you slander us!

33:44.270 --> 33:46.400
Are you trying to force us to violence?

33:46.830 --> 33:48.440
That ungrateful old weasel!

33:48.440 --> 33:49.110
Tang Fang.

33:50.110 --> 33:51.370
Don't bother with him.

33:51.680 --> 33:52.720
That weak man.

33:53.680 --> 33:54.230
Let's go.

33:59.680 --> 34:00.680
That Ding fellow—

34:00.880 --> 34:02.260
you don't need to beg him.

34:02.260 --> 34:03.350
He's a coward.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.530
We can go elsewhere.

34:05.400 --> 34:08.659
I'm afraid everyone
in the Chuanjin community is the same.

34:10.150 --> 34:10.840
Tang Fang.

34:11.400 --> 34:13.460
Thank you for your help along the way.

34:13.670 --> 34:14.630
Let's part here.

34:16.710 --> 34:17.320
Wait.

34:18.150 --> 34:19.280
Where are you going?

34:24.190 --> 34:27.650
Old Madam Wu has sent someone
to deliver a letter to my brother.

34:28.070 --> 34:29.130
Perhaps my brother

34:29.150 --> 34:32.110
can find heroes in the martial world
to save the Xiao family.

34:32.110 --> 34:34.590
So I need to go back to meet with them.

34:35.280 --> 34:38.739
There's still one family in Jinzhong
you haven't approached.

34:41.190 --> 34:42.000
You mean...

34:43.760 --> 34:44.620
Your Tang Sect?

34:50.510 --> 34:54.170
But Tang Sect never gets involved
in the martial world's affairs.

34:54.550 --> 34:55.560
As you said,

34:56.100 --> 34:58.030
what the Xiao family suffers today

34:58.320 --> 35:00.050
may befall Tang Sect tomorrow.

35:00.230 --> 35:02.310
Actually, Tang Rou asked me before

35:03.280 --> 35:06.610
why the Tang family
lets rats like the Power Gang run rampant

35:06.670 --> 35:09.670
instead of becoming
the foremost family in the world.

35:09.670 --> 35:11.710
I still want to try to persuade my father.

35:11.710 --> 35:12.670
But if I fail,

35:13.150 --> 35:14.810
I'll go with you to Guangling.

35:14.920 --> 35:15.920
What do you think?

35:21.800 --> 35:22.400
Okay.

35:23.360 --> 35:24.820
Then we can only try first.

35:27.190 --> 35:27.840
Tang Fang,

35:28.710 --> 35:30.040
thank you for your help.

35:33.150 --> 35:34.610
I can't promise anything.

35:34.920 --> 35:35.780
Let's just try.

35:39.550 --> 35:41.150
[Is there really no way out]

35:41.520 --> 35:43.660
[if I don't follow the mission guidance?]

35:43.660 --> 35:46.920
[Tang Sect, Jinzhong]

35:50.880 --> 35:51.510
My Lady.

35:55.440 --> 35:56.500
Where's my father?

35:56.840 --> 35:57.880
Master is in the inner hall.

35:57.880 --> 35:59.140
Please go there first.

36:01.320 --> 36:02.000
Wait here.

36:02.400 --> 36:03.600
I'll go get my father.

36:49.670 --> 36:50.230
Sir.

36:51.960 --> 36:53.560
Please sit and enjoy the tea.

37:00.510 --> 37:01.110
Thank you.

37:38.740 --> 37:40.060
[Tang Qing from Tang Sect]

37:43.860 --> 37:45.680
[Tang Song from Tang Sect]

37:50.920 --> 37:51.760
Fang,

37:52.320 --> 37:53.250
long time no see.

37:53.880 --> 37:54.670
Tang Song.

37:55.710 --> 37:56.770
Where's my father?

37:57.440 --> 38:01.040
He's naturally handling family affairs
in the inner courtyard.

38:01.820 --> 38:04.150
You're being reckless with your brother.

38:05.320 --> 38:08.120
Aren't you worried
Old Madam Tang will punish you?

38:09.070 --> 38:10.480
You're the reckless one.

38:11.300 --> 38:12.820
She favors you,

38:13.360 --> 38:16.020
so you can show no respect
for Tang Sect's rules?

38:19.360 --> 38:22.220
Let's see
how long you can keep that defiant tongue.

38:22.360 --> 38:23.150
Fang,

38:23.670 --> 38:26.280
how dare you bring an outsider
to Tang Sect to seek reinforcements?

38:26.280 --> 38:29.190
And you had the audacity
to write in your letter to Master

38:29.190 --> 38:30.590
about returning a favor.

38:30.710 --> 38:31.920
How laughable.

38:32.430 --> 38:34.880
You actually
opened my private letter to Father?

38:34.880 --> 38:38.480
You want to use the Tang family's power
to solve the Xiao family's crisis,

38:38.480 --> 38:40.880
meddling in their feud
with the Power Gang.

38:41.320 --> 38:42.800
This is no private matter.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.590
I have my reasons.

38:45.110 --> 38:46.590
If you have a problem with that,

38:46.590 --> 38:48.590
let's go talk before Old Madam Tang.

38:50.920 --> 38:54.110
Do you really think she doesn't know

38:55.000 --> 38:56.590
what we are doing?

38:57.320 --> 38:58.400
Detaining you now

38:58.800 --> 38:59.840
is just to punish you

38:59.840 --> 39:02.710
for promising help to outsiders
without permission.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.760
If this really goes before her,

39:05.710 --> 39:07.440
your branch's secret plot
to embezzle the treasure—

39:07.440 --> 39:09.320
a capital offense—

39:11.110 --> 39:12.400
will be exposed.

39:13.440 --> 39:15.000
I don't know what you're talking about.

39:15.000 --> 39:16.280
She's indeed defiant.

39:16.950 --> 39:18.630
I've already received the news.

39:18.630 --> 39:20.960
The Xiao family is being besieged
by the Power Gang

39:20.960 --> 39:22.890
because of the Hero Command Token.

39:23.000 --> 39:24.670
And the scheme of that Xiao boy

39:24.670 --> 39:25.670
you brought here—

39:26.230 --> 39:27.490
you don't really think

39:27.760 --> 39:30.710
Old Madam Tang
can't see through it, do you?

39:35.150 --> 39:36.150
You might as well

39:37.350 --> 39:38.810
just marry me obediently.

39:43.590 --> 39:45.960
I could cover this up for you.

39:46.670 --> 39:48.470
You're getting more shameless.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.210
Why don't you stop talking and act?

39:52.510 --> 39:53.070
Let's go.

39:53.710 --> 39:55.070
Let's go together to Old Madam Tang

39:55.070 --> 39:56.400
and lay everything out.

39:56.550 --> 39:57.710
I'd like to see

39:58.670 --> 40:01.550
if she'll believe you two.

40:01.920 --> 40:02.710
No rush.

40:03.960 --> 40:05.030
I've taken down

40:05.030 --> 40:06.290
that Xiao boy outside.

40:06.800 --> 40:09.280
Once I find the Hero Command Token on him,

40:11.110 --> 40:11.920
Fang,

40:13.070 --> 40:15.360
your guilt will be confirmed.

40:15.550 --> 40:19.480
Don't blame me for showing no mercy then.

40:23.460 --> 40:25.580
[Hailin Sect]

40:25.110 --> 40:25.670
Master!

40:26.360 --> 40:27.000
Master!

40:27.670 --> 40:28.870
Young Master is back!

40:29.170 --> 40:29.630
Father.

40:33.550 --> 40:34.190
What?

40:35.190 --> 40:37.030
You caused trouble out there

40:35.370 --> 40:37.340
[Deng Qingfeng, Master of Hailin Sect]

40:37.030 --> 40:38.360
and couldn't handle it,

40:38.960 --> 40:40.490
so you decided to come back?

40:40.760 --> 40:43.590
Now you recall you have a father?

40:44.430 --> 40:45.960
It's not like that, Father.

40:46.880 --> 40:49.450
Enough. Go to the Reflection Hall first.

40:50.030 --> 40:52.910
Reflect for 5 days
and then come back to talk to me.

40:53.110 --> 40:53.590
Father.

40:54.670 --> 40:57.400
I came back today
to seek help for the Xiao family.

40:58.070 --> 40:59.530
The Power Gang is ruthless

40:59.800 --> 41:02.000
and has surrounded Xiao's Sword Manor.

41:02.540 --> 41:06.660
So you know the Power Gang is ruthless?

41:07.000 --> 41:09.070
Then why do you want our entire family

41:09.070 --> 41:11.400
and the entire clan to stand against them?

41:15.470 --> 41:16.870
From the very beginning,

41:17.630 --> 41:20.070
you never
should have followed Xiao Qiushui

41:20.070 --> 41:21.070
to provoke them.

41:21.510 --> 41:22.630
But Mr. Xiao and Mrs. Xiao

41:22.630 --> 41:23.630
are now in danger.

41:24.110 --> 41:25.880
How can I just stand by and do nothing?

41:25.880 --> 41:27.440
Do you think hiding and avoiding

41:27.440 --> 41:28.840
will keep trouble at bay?

41:28.920 --> 41:31.180
How do you know the Power Gang's next step

41:31.230 --> 41:33.110
won't be to invade Qianxi, Father?

41:33.110 --> 41:35.880
It's not your place as a junior

41:36.150 --> 41:37.810
to worry about these matters.

41:38.510 --> 41:39.510
Hailin Sect

41:41.030 --> 41:43.360
entered the Central Plains martial world

41:43.630 --> 41:46.280
for further expansion
with the heart of upholding justice.

41:46.280 --> 41:47.210
The Deng family,

41:47.590 --> 41:49.590
though only a branch in Qianxi,

41:50.130 --> 41:52.480
has never dared
forget our original aspiration.

41:52.480 --> 41:54.760
Father, since I was a kid,

41:55.360 --> 41:56.290
you've taught me

41:57.590 --> 42:00.990
in character and in martial arts,
loyalty is the foundation.

42:01.150 --> 42:02.810
I have engraved it in my heart.

42:03.540 --> 42:06.660
You were once close friends with Mr. Xiao,

42:07.720 --> 42:11.520
traveling in the martial world
and overcoming hardships together—

42:11.740 --> 42:13.480
just like Qiushui and me today.

42:14.330 --> 42:14.990
But Father,

42:16.270 --> 42:19.500
why have you become
so cautious and hesitant now?

42:24.960 --> 42:26.620
If you refuse to help, so be it.

42:27.360 --> 42:29.630
I will do what I can for the Xiao family.

42:30.880 --> 42:31.440
You...

42:33.710 --> 42:34.630
Stop him!
